<h2 style="color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Appointment Request Received</h2>
<p style="color: #334155; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Hi {{patientName}}, we have received your appointment request. It is currently <strong>pending</strong> and will be confirmed by the doctor.</p>
<div style="background: #f1f5f9; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0;">
  <p style="margin: 4px 0; color: #334155;"><strong>Doctor:</strong> Dr. {{doctorName}}</p>
  <p style="margin: 4px 0; color: #334155;"><strong>Date:</strong> {{date}}</p>
  <p style="margin: 4px 0; color: #334155;"><strong>Time:</strong> {{time}}</p>
</div>
<p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; margin: 0;">You will receive another email once the doctor confirms your appointment.</p>
